    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Apr 2024 09:02:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果地球即将毁灭，必须要两人去旅行才能拯救地球</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是选择你爸爸和你的前任还是你和你前任的现任呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天yuki和lala再来和大家聊聊旅游</span></p><span></span><p><span>说说那些一拍即合的旅游搭子还有那些让我们头大的扫兴人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 奇怪旅游话题探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 和P人的旅游日记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a> 准备勇敢尝试一人旅行 （心里建设中...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 和家人出去需要做更大的心里准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> 家庭旅行中的矛盾与协调：我当导游的酸甜苦辣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 和男朋友出去玩的好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 精致男人的龟毛令人崩溃！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a> 旅行中的矛盾与和解：集体行动中的个人需求VS团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3444">57:24</a> 情侣出游，考验爱情的最佳方式！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3787">01:03:07</a> 旅行中最快乐的时刻！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: dating myself-Sad Alex</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
