    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Apr 2024 13:39:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>年轻、无知，装修小白的真实案例！</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟lala和yuki，来一场关于**痛苦边缘**与**幸福顶峰**的两极旅程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>装修过程里隐藏的雷区是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>装修心得和小妙招又有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起聚焦装修烦恼，轻松搞定你的梦想家园！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> 简约风格的二手房，实际有点家徒四壁的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 装修前的焦虑与困惑：小白的装修经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 装修预算预估与实际花费的差距</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 细节控强迫症别碰装修</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 如何选择装修风格？建议多看看案例并坚持自己的审美！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3517">58:37</a> 家居美学：颜色搭配与审美眼光的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: 新窝-飞轮海/S.H.E</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
