  <item>
    <title>Vol.20 霸凌者 希望你永远躲不过你的现世报</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fbeedb1519139e4fb8cb26</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fbeedb1519139e4fb8cb26</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Mar 2024 08:24:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你曾受了很多苦 但这不是你的错</span></p><span></span><p><span>疼痛会渐渐忘却</span></p><span></span><p><span>但伤疤会留下痕迹</span></p><span></span><p><span>施暴者一句轻描淡写的对不起</span></p><span></span><p><span>永远无法抹去被霸凌人一生的伤痛</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们不仅为邯郸的少年发声</span></p><span></span><p><span>也痛斥那些曾经或是现在还在做霸凌者的每一位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 或许霸凌就发生在我们的身边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> 我们在童年时期被欺负的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 比起身体上的暴力，职场上无声的霸凌也深深伤害着我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2795">46:35</a> 网络上的语言暴力有时会更伤人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3329">55:29</a> 如果我们有了孩子又该怎么去教导他们呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3899">01:04:59</a> 霸凌的人永远都不该被原谅！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4150">01:09:10</a> 沉默的旁观者</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: 我用什么把你留住-福禄寿</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><br><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
