  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 当脆皮年轻人开始养生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f3cff4696bd9a87953a8df</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f3cff4696bd9a87953a8df</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Mar 2024 04:34:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>购买养生产品 是生活的仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span>当代年轻人谁手上还没有几瓶鱼油vc钙片了</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这个快节奏的时代</span></p><span></span><p><span>新中式养生让我们的身体和心灵都可以慢下来</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天yuki和lala一起来聊聊我们和朋友的那些养生方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 枸杞泡啤酒 一边养生一遍摆烂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 我们是怎么走上养生这条路的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 极端的养生方式是好还是不好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> 当代营销方式促使我吃上了各种保健品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 老年人难改的“养生习惯”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 开始减肥后养成的好习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> 新型的锻炼方式和养生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 冥想让我的脑子慢下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a> 年轻人一大酷刑：控制自己玩手机的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> 比起身体的疗愈 更重要的是心理的健康</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3193">53:13</a> 年轻人新型聚会方式：足浴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3332">55:32</a> 颈椎病：打工人的恶疾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">01:00:10</a> 网上的营销手段太多，还是要因人而异</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: 青花瓷-周杰伦</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
