  <item>
    <title>Vol.18 宇宙的尽头是玄学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e86ecdbba370f4653d5e90</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e86ecdbba370f4653d5e90</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 13:25:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>遇事不决 先问玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span>玄学可以说是当今年轻人中讨论度非常高的话题了</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是八字还是星座</span></p><span></span><p><span>也不管是塔罗牌还是算命抽签</span></p><span></span><p><span>好像遇到事了先看看玄学怎么说准没错</span></p><span></span><p><span>yuki和lala作为各路玄学边缘性信徒</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天来讨论看看我们从小到大遇见的邪门故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 觉醒的传统基因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 星座预示别太准，Alex大叔我真的没叔不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> 有事没事算算塔罗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> 我的第六感别太准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 上班上进不如上香</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> 这算命算的我不得不信啊啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 自带的磁场真的会影响我的一生嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> 真的有人能看见大家看不见的东西嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a> 吓人！让人觉得毛骨悚然的住宿体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> 儿时的邪门故事 长大后真的不敢细想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">48:38</a> 托梦到底是我们的执念还是去世的人真的来找我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3737">01:02:17</a> 陕西地方邪 先人建议大家谨言慎行</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: r.i.p-Virginia To Vegas</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
