  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 Dating app上划到你 是我罪有应得</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ba5ffadde969cfdc2c7eb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ba5ffadde969cfdc2c7eb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jan 2024 14:58:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>要过年啦！你也有被催婚的恐惧嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有没有尝试过新型盲盒dating app呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天三位混迹在各大dating app的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起来聊聊在app上见识到的形形色色的男嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 大家是为什么开始玩dating app的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 线上都没聊好怎么能线下见面呢？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 选择心动男嘉宾的第一要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 无法理解的男生简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 谁说dating app上的人和自己走不到最后的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 你也会在dating app上立人设嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">44:09</a> 为大家表演一个一秒下头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a> 第一次见面送鸡汤？到底是准备给我下什么迷魂药？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 求求了 给我们老会员也推荐点高质量男人吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a> 没必要对网友上头 摆正玩app的心态就当是观察物种多样性了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3692">01:01:32</a> 和这种人聊天 我尴尬癌都犯了啊！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4021">01:07:01</a> 请为搞笑女留一些市场吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4393">01:13:13</a> 在钓鱼这事儿上 姐也是有点心眼儿的</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小一</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: 说爱你-蔡依林</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><br><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
