  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 断舍离：把不重要的东西挪出去，才能让有价值的事物进来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65acc6a7093843c31ad3c881</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65acc6a7093843c31ad3c881</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jan 2024 07:24:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>断，断绝不需要的东西；</span></p><span></span><p><span>舍，舍取多余的废物；</span></p><span></span><p><span>离，脱离对物品的执着，</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在对自己来说不重要的，就尽管放手。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;——《断舍离》</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家是否也定期断舍离扔掉一些长期不用的物品呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>还是有收集癖 爱攒各种乱七八糟用不到东西。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天yuki和lala来聊聊自己和父母长辈那些断不掉的物件</span></p><span></span><p><span>和我们逐渐改变的消费习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> yuki妈妈纠结的断舍离内心活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> 老人：断舍离是什么东西？纯属浪费！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> lala：看不顺眼的都扔了准没错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a> 珍贵的东西是摆出来陈列呢还是藏起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a> 为了日后不乱扔，先从改变消费习惯开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 你有没有冲动买过什么一点没用的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 逐渐开始极简生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: &nbsp;Let Go-BTS</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
