    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>不管这一年是好片烂片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝我们都快乐杀青！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2023年还剩一天就要过去啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们一起来复盘下本年的经历和挑战吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于这一年，你满意嘛？又对2024抱有什么样的期待呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2023全剧终</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们明年再见！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>祝所有朋友新年快乐！心想事成！身体健康！财源滚滚！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 把突如其来的想法做了这么久，谢谢我们的坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 我们做播客的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 感谢每一位听众朋友，更谢谢一直指点我们的uu</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> yuki和lala心中的top3播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 我们的创业项目在年末终于也小有成就</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 今年是我们不平凡的一年更是充满挑战的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> 2024我对自己的期望</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Yuki｜lala</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Ditto-NewJeans</span></p><span></span><p><span>Email: lularecord.ovo@gmail.com</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜苹果播客 均可以收听到我们的节目哦 :)</span></p>]]></description>
